The IPA is confusing and most people looking at it won't know how to read 
it.
However, I do not advocate the creation of another standard notation. 
Either way, its one more thing someone must learn before learning lojban.
The simpler the learning of lojban is the better.

As it stands, prospective jbopre must obtain some sense of predicate logic 
before lojban makes any sense (and the current learning materials make no 
effort to help people who do not have a background in math or CS to learn 
these concepts).

